                  <td>
                    Withholding child support, domestic abuse, custody disputes.
                  </td>
                  <td>
                    Domestic turmoil is viewed as a private matter where state
                    intervention is discouraged.
                  </td>
                  <td>
                    Codifying family disputes into entitlements regarding
                    support and welfare.
                  </td>
                </tr>
